
This is a package for creating presentations.  The description of the
files are as follows.

talkpal.sty : The style file that is necessary for creating the
presentation.  It should be kept either in the area where all
tex/latex distribution files are kept on the computer.  Alternatively,
it can be put in any directory, but then it will work only within that
directory.

manual.pdf : A pdf file which explains how to use the package.  It also
serves as a sample of the use of talkpal, since it has been created by
using talkpal.

manual.tex : A .tex file that uses talkpal.sty and creates manual.pdf.

